            "X-Demo-Account": "mock01",
            "Content-Type": "application/json"
          },
          "body": {
            "order_no": "{{order_no}}",
            "channel_trade_no": "PAY-S1-001",
            "amount": 20000,
            "signature_valid": true
          },
          "trigger": "可控 HTTP 模拟渠道通知入口即定稿清单 API-04 / API-10 / API-14；通过 signature_valid、success、amount、channel_trade_no 触发成功/失败/验签失败/金额不符/未知订单/重复通知，无独立真实第三方服务",
